{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月9日，英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳的私人醜聞引發市場劇烈反應，公司股價盤中一度下跌8.8%，按此前約4.5萬億美元的市值計算，市值最大縮水約3960億美元，已經創下上市公司因高管個人醜聞引發的最大單日市值損失紀錄。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585650.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.387551+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T15:26:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"26414843fc2c81346a9eb777f5f429beba88ec46e782f856ce4521ce33d5e1bb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}